{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299430/extras/7b5619c09beac77d1de0694448192761.avif?t=1759421727\" width=624 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a skilled computer engineer, but your darkest secret has fallen into the wrong hands. Someone is blackmailing you, forcing you into a high-stakes game of <strong>hacking</strong> and <strong>espionage</strong>. Your task? <i>Break into servers</i>, <i>steal sensitive data</i>, and fulfill their demands. But the question lingers\u2014will you carry out their missions, or will you track them down and seek revenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299430/extras/0bb9fa4fc7838b8e50e29b6e4349b1d5.avif?t=1759421727\" width=616 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this immersive, interactive story, you take on the role of a computer engineer working through a command-line interface. You have access to a wide range of hacking commands and can infiltrate increasingly secure servers. As you progress, the risks and pressure grow greater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299430/extras/5a36132c3edb5c2d67cefa0ef2e1387f.poster.avif?t=1759421727\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299430/extras/5a36132c3edb5c2d67cefa0ef2e1387f.webm?t=1759421727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299430/extras/5a36132c3edb5c2d67cefa0ef2e1387f.mp4?t=1759421727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Hack and Connect</strong>: Use your tools to penetrate firewalls, exploit weaknesses, and outwit defense systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Download and Manipulate</strong>: Secure the files you need, but beware\u2014every move you make is being watched.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Adapt and Evolve</strong>: Modify your tactics as new challenges arise, from firewalls to counter-hacking attempts. Each success brings you closer to either freedom or further entanglement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One way to find out: Dive into the gripping world of <strong>Extortion</strong> and choose your path.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"From white to black hat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299430/2f9e5002bb4960cac524ee0dac367a4ac49b870e.jpg"},{"name":"Merge this!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299430/d814b93e708056d1d4a3988bcf318b36d438a6b8.jpg"},{"name":"Ready to open","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299430/137115def02b7f936da27229341356a895ea109c.jpg"},{"name":"Zealous victim","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299430/5b9617b8405e00380090d908aae0a5d1b634b82d.jpg"},{"name":"Guess who ?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299430/428998f4d892ae4f28cc216a3207273999a8ad7f.jpg"},{"name":"Grrrrr","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299430/de4abfb0dbf651c3416854c946aca4b4dd4c1cbf.jpg"},{"name":"Krach","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299430/8e30dd8d35b71112548847e22fd562297e401c9e.jpg"},{"name":"Diversionception",